    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d497">

                <pb facs="0945" n="933" sameAs="frus:frus1946v09/pg933"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119PW/6–146</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the State–War–Navy Coordinating
                        Committee to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">SWN 4367</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-06-01">1 June 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">Subject: Security Implications in Manchurian Situation.</p>
                <p>Enclosed is a copy of SWNCC 291/1, a report by the State–War–Navy Coordinating
                    Subcommittee for the Far East, which has been <pb facs="0946" n="934"
                        xml:id="pg934"/> transmitted for approval by the State–War–Navy Coordinating
                    Committee.</p>
                <p>In view of the Recommendations contained in paragraph 5 <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >a</hi>, it is requested that the Department of State transmit, as a matter
                    of urgency, the Conclusions of this paper as contained in paragraph 4 to General
                    Marshall for comment to include his opinion on the advisability of requesting
                    Presidential approval of these Conclusions and that General Marshall’s comments,
                    when obtained, be furnished the Secretariat, SWNCC, for circulation to the
                    Committee for the action contemplated in paragraph 5 <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >b</hi> of the Recommendations.<anchor n="46" xml:id="d497-f1"/></p>
                <p>For the State–War–Navy Coordinating Committee:</p>
                <closer><signed>H. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Freeman
                        Matthews</hi></signed><lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Acting
                    Chairman</hi></closer>




                <xi:include href="d497-a1.xml" xpointer="d497-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d497-a2.xml" xpointer="d497-a2"/>
                <xi:include href="d497-a3.xml" xpointer="d497-a3"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
